# NeMo Gym — code ownership
#
# Two kinds of lines in this file:
#
#   <path-pattern> @user-or-team ...
#     Standard CODEOWNERS syntax. ENFORCED: GitHub auto-requests review from
#     these owners, and main's branch protection requires their approval
#     before merge.
#
#   # suggest: <path-pattern> @user-or-team ...
#     Same path-pattern syntax, prefixed with a literal `# suggest:` comment
#     tag. ADVISORY ONLY: GitHub's CODEOWNERS parser ignores every line
#     starting with `#`, so these can never become required reviewers no
#     matter what branch protection does. .github/workflows/suggest-reviewers.yml
#     reads only these tagged lines and requests those users/teams as PR
#     reviewers (visible in the Reviewers sidebar) without blocking merge.
#
# Put a `# suggest:` line right under the enforced rule it relates to, so
# there's one file to update instead of two.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern for a path, for both kinds of line
# independently.

# ── Enforced ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.github/ @nvidia-nemo/automation
docker/ @nvidia-nemo/automation
/pyproject.toml @nvidia-nemo/automation
/uv.lock @nvidia-nemo/automation

